bruary and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 37% of normal and September to October at 45%. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle came in at 178% of normal. All 3 grids had their driest year in 1953, with grid 22941 at 56%.</p>"}
